"cloud.consent.disclosure" = "When this is on and the on-device answer can’t handle a question, the selected handwriting (an image of the selection and the area around it) and its text reading are sent to a private server and on to Google’s Gemini service, which writes the answer. Google may keep requests briefly for abuse monitoring and does not use them to train models. Nothing is sent when this is off, when this build has no access key, or for questions the iPad can answer itself. Turn it off any time.";
